Description: 4k intro for Linux, released in 2012
 "what a failure" is a 4k intro by Ye Olde Laptops Posse (code and music
 by provod), released at TokyoDemoFest 2012 where it ranked 2nd in the
 combined demo/intro competition.
 .
 It simulates 4096 particles with SPH (smoothed-particle hydrodynamics)
 and requires an OpenGL 2.1 capable video card.
